	quest.1B86FADD079A8A39.quest_desc: ["在葱郁的森林和洞穴（Lush Caves）中开采橄榄石。用Necoium将其熔炼！"]
	quest.1B86FADD079A8A39.title: "水晶：橄榄石（Peridoto）"
